 "boards": [
  {
   "file": "Collectors.dc.html",
   "title": "Collectors · list, add, Folder collector",
   "heading": "Collectors · built-in Folder",
   "intro": "Collectors fill the queue on a schedule: <b>Folder</b> (built in) or a <b>custom script</b>. The detail answers one question at a glance, “is it working, and what did it last do?”: a status card, a compact read-only settings block (Edit turns it into a form in place), and the last three runs. Healthy rows in the list have no pill; only Running, Failed and Needs your OK do. Adding is three short steps with defaults (Folder: <code>~/Distill Inbox</code>, Keep the original, every hour, the active vault). Folder copies by default and remembers what it took (by content), shown as the <b>Already collected</b> link with Forget.",
   "width": 2520,
   "sections": [
    {
     "row": [
      "collectors-empty",
      "collectors-add"
     ],
     "style": "display: flex; gap: 40px; align-items: flex-start"
    },
    {
     "row": [
      "collectors-add-folder",
      "collectors-add-schedule"
     ],
     "style": "display: flex; gap: 40px; align-items: flex-start"
    },
    {
     "row": [
      "collectors-folder",
      "collectors-folder-edit"
     ],
     "style": "display: flex; gap: 40px; align-items: flex-start"
    },
    {
     "row": [
      "collectors-folder-collected",
      "collectors-folder-running"
     ],
     "style": "display: flex; gap: 40px; align-items: flex-start"
    },
    {
     "row": [
      "collectors-folder-history",
      "collectors-folder-missing"
     ],
     "style": "display: flex; gap: 40px; align-items: flex-start"
    },
    {
     "frame": "collectors-folder-no-permission"
    },
    {
     "title": "Around the list"
    },
    {
     "grid": [
      "collectors-card-in-queue",
      "collectors-card-menu"
     ],
     "cols": 4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "file": "CollectorsScript.dc.html",
   "title": "Collectors · custom script (consent, schedule, run log)",
   "heading": "Collectors · custom script",
   "intro": "Same layout as Folder. Setup is two sheet steps (script, then schedule), then the new collector asks once before it ever runs: <b>“Distill will run this code on your Mac as you”</b>, with the code shown. The allowance is tied to the script’s sha256, so a changed script pauses and asks again. At a glance: status card, settings (script, schedule, allowed), and the last runs; interpreter, timeout, cron and the arguments it gets ($1/$2, DISTILL_VAULT, DISTILL_QUEUE_DIR) sit under <b>Advanced</b>. Output shows only in an opened run, or live while it runs.",
   "width": 2520,
   "sections": [
    {
     "row": [
      "collectors-add-script",
      "collectors-script-consent"
     ],
     "style": "display: flex; gap: 40px; align-items: flex-start"
    },
    {
     "row": [
      "collectors-script",
      "collectors-script-edit"
     ],
     "style": "display: flex; gap: 40px; align-items: flex-start"
    },
    {
     "row": [
      "collectors-script-log",
      "collectors-script-running"
     ],
     "style": "display: flex; gap: 40px; align-items: flex-start"
    },
    {
     "row": [
      "collectors-script-failed",
      "collectors-script-changed"
     ],
     "style": "display: flex; gap: 40px; align-items: flex-start"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
